{"id":"5794","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5794_main_noctilucent-cloud-complex-type-o_special-clouds-and-other-features.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>本照片为不符合I至IV型的夜光云状。这是复合结构O型。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Pekka Parviainen","location":"芬兰，图尔库","latitude":"纬度: 60° 27' 6'' N","longitude":"经度: 22° 15' 60'' E","date":"16 July 1978 2125 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.10U.3.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.10U.3.5"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5687_main_noctilucent-cloud-complex-structure_special-clouds-and-other-features.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>通常在夜光云的影像中可同时看到几种形态。因此，两个或更多相交或重叠的云簇形成亮结或网状结构等复合结构，或是不适合标准分类的云型都并不罕见。本图恰在午夜前在加拿大艾伯塔省埃德蒙顿地区拍摄，图中是一种此类复合结构的夜光云影像。影像的中间部分是奇异的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波浪状云，中间有许多网眼</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Mark Zalcik","location":"加拿大，艾伯塔省，纳冒","latitude":"纬度: 53° 43' 2'' N","longitude":"经度: 113° 29' 39'' W","date":"26 June 2014 2343 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10"}]}]}